   "blocks": [
    {
     "title": "Stadium Competitive updates",
     "body": "Fixed an issue where players near their predicted rank started to gain extremely low Stadium Points. We have adjusted the Stadium Ranked distribution curve to make it easier to reach Elite rank for most players. We have made adjustments to reduce the amount of Stadium Points lost when players lose a match, as each round won now provides a greater reduction in the overall point loss. We have made adjustments to the maximum and minimum amount of Stadium Points that can be won or lost from a competitive match.",
     "dev": "Developer Comments: The dynamic updates to Stadium Competitive have made progressing in the system feel more difficult as players are now finding their predicted ranks faster. We are making improvements to smooth out this experience and will keep a close eye on this as we head into Season 19."
    }
   ]
  },
