     "title": "Heroes",
     "body": "Mercy Fixed an issue with the animation and voice line of Mercy's Ultimate in Overwatch Classic. Wuyang Fixed an issue where Wuyang's Ultimate sometimes targeted closer enemies than intended.",
     "dev": null
    },
    {
     "title": "Maps",
     "body": "Aatlis Fixed an issue with the stairs in Aatlis and the map has been re-enabled.",
     "dev": null
    },
    {
     "title": "Stadium",
     "body": "Moira Fixed an issue where Moira's Power Optimal Overflow spawned Biotic Orbs without reduced duration. Pharah Fixed an issue where Pharah's Triple Volley rockets dealt more damage than intended. Reinhardt Fixed an issue where Reinhardt's Power Shield Stampede caused camera to not lock in place during Charge. Soldier: 76 Fixed an issue where Soldier 76's Power Peripheral Pulse didn't deal reduced damage to additional targets during Tactical Visor.",
